# Window: partition leader promotion after a node fails, between the new
#   leader collecting the survivors' repair logs and repairing them.
#   SpPromoteAlgo / MpPromoteAlgo.repairSurvivors run under the initiator
#   mailbox's deliver lock, so a delay here holds the new leader, and every
#   message to it, before repair completes.
#
# Fault: delay each repairSurvivors call by 3 s on the surviving nodes.
#
# Correct behaviour: no lost or duplicated transactions (the workload
#   checker), the promoted leaders take over, and the killed node rejoins.

RULE promotion-delay sp
CLASS org.voltdb.iv2.SpPromoteAlgo
METHOD repairSurvivors
AT ENTRY
IF TRUE
DO traceln("BYTEMAN promotion-delay fired sp");
   delay(3000)
ENDRULE

RULE promotion-delay mp
CLASS org.voltdb.iv2.MpPromoteAlgo
METHOD repairSurvivors
AT ENTRY
IF TRUE
DO traceln("BYTEMAN promotion-delay fired mp");
   delay(3000)
ENDRULE
